# Per-branch working notes: an append-only log whose value expires on merge, so
# it conflicts across concurrent branches and swamps diffs. The durable prose
# belongs in the commit message and PR body instead.
# tasks/lessons.md is deliberately NOT ignored — it is a standing instruction
# file like CLAUDE.md, and agents are told to read it at session start.
tasks/todo.md